<title>UK: Flextech yr pre-tax, pre-except loss flat.</title>
<headline>Flextech yr pre-tax, pre-except loss flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.09 loss	   vs 17.24 loss</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-except     16.83 loss	   vs 16.86 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   65.16		  vs 34.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Flextech, which earlier detailed two pay-television deals with BBC Worldwide Ltd, said exceptional items included a 2.58 million credit in 1996 and a 33.24 million stg credit in 1995 after sales.</p>
<p>Full company name - Flextech Plc</p>
</text>
